<%= govuk_details(summary_text: "SLA definitions") do %>
  <p class="govuk-body">The service level agreements (SLA) are targets for how long it should take to assess applications. SLAs are calculated in working days.</p>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-s govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">10 day SLA</h2>
  <p class="govuk-body">Prioritisation checks must be completed within 10 days of the application being submitted. "Nearing" is shown 8 days after submission.</p>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-s govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">40 day SLA</h2>
  <p class="govuk-body">Initial assessment must be completed within 40 days of the application being submitted. "Nearing" is shown 35 days after submission.</p>

  <h2 class="govuk-heading-s govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">80 day SLA</h2>
  <p class="govuk-body">All applications must have an outcome within 80 days of the application being submitted. "Nearing" is shown 65 days after submission.</p>
<% end %>
